# 🏆 Project JohAR — AR-Based Vocational Training Simulator for Industrial Safety
## SIH 2026 | PS ID: 26041 | Government of Jharkhand

> **Product Name: Project JohAR** ("Johar" = Jharkhand Greeting + "AR" = Augmented Reality)
> A complete end-to-end industrial safety training, certification, and compliance ecosystem for Jharkhand's mining & manufacturing workforce.

---

## 1. The Big Picture — Why We Win

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **We are NOT building "just an AR app."** We are building a **complete safety ecosystem** — from a worker's first day of orientation to their ongoing compliance, from a mine supervisor's real-time dashboard to a DGMS auditor's verification portal. Every other team will submit an AR demo. We submit a **production-grade platform**.

### Our Winning Formula

| Dimension | What Others Will Do | What We Do |
|:---|:---|:---|
| **Training** | AR-only modules | **Blended Learning**: Video → Quiz → AR Simulation → Assessment (4-stage pedagogy) |
| **Language** | Hindi + English text | **Voice-First in Santali + Hindi + English** with Ol Chiki script support |
| **Certification** | Basic PDF certificate | **QR-verified, blockchain-anchored, DGMS-format certificates** |
| **Offline** | Partial/broken | **Offline-first architecture** — works in zero-connectivity mine zones |
| **Engagement** | One-time training | **Gamified spaced repetition** — daily 5-min drills with XP, badges, leaderboards |
| **Admin** | Basic dashboard | **Real-time compliance dashboard** with heatmaps, risk analytics, audit trails |
| **Extras** | None | **AI-powered incident prediction**, **family safety SMS**, **Admin broadcast alerts** |

