## 6. Tech Stack

### Mobile App (Android)

| Layer | Technology | Why |
|:------|:-----------|:----|
| **Framework** | **Unity + AR Foundation** | Cross-platform AR, rich 3D rendering, largest ecosystem for AR assets. Judges recognize Unity. |
| **AR Engine** | **Google ARCore** (via AR Foundation) | Plane detection, image tracking, light estimation — all needed for our scenarios |
| **3D Assets** | **Blender** (modeling) + **glTF/GLB** format | Free, lightweight, industry standard |
| **Language** | **C#** (Unity scripts) | Unity's primary language |
| **Offline DB** | **SQLite** (via Unity plugin) | Stores progress, certificates, training data locally |
| **TTS/Voice** | **Sarvam AI API** + **Indic Parler-TTS** (offline fallback) | Best Santali + Hindi voice quality available |
| **QR Generation** | **ZXing.Net** library | Proven QR generation within Unity |
| **Video Player** | **Unity VideoPlayer** component | Embedded training videos |
| **Animations** | **Lottie for Unity** | Lightweight JSON animations for UI |

### Web Admin Dashboard

| Layer | Technology | Why |
|:------|:-----------|:----|
| **Frontend** | **React.js** + **Recharts** + **Tailwind CSS** | Fast, modern, beautiful dashboards |
| **Backend** | **Node.js + Express** | Lightweight REST API, easy to deploy |
| **Database** | **Supabase (PostgreSQL)** | Open-source, relational data for complex querying (e.g., mines, workers, certs) |
| **Auth** | **Supabase Auth** | Open-source, prevents vendor lock-in (preferred by govt judges) |
| **Hosting** | **Vercel / Render** | Free tier sufficient for hackathon |
| **QR Verification** | **Public REST endpoint** | Anyone can verify a certificate by scanning QR |

### Certificate & Blockchain

| Layer | Technology | Why |
|:------|:-----------|:----|
| **Hash** | **SHA-256** | Industry standard, deterministic |
| **Blockchain (Demo)** | **Ganache (local Ethereum)** or **simulated chain** | For hackathon demo; production would use Polygon/Solana |
| **Smart Contract** | **Solidity** (basic) | Stores certificate hashes on-chain |

### AI/ML Components

| Component | Technology |
|:----------|:-----------|
| **Weak-spot detection** | Simple analytics on quiz response data (rule-based for hackathon, ML for production) |
| **Voice commands** | Android Speech Recognition API (offline Hindi supported) |
| **Language detection** | Heuristic-based (user selects language; auto-detect as v2) |

