## 8. Detailed Module Design (2 Complete AR Modules for Demo)

### Module 1: Fire & Explosion Response 🔥

| Stage | Content | Interaction |
|:------|:--------|:------------|
| **Watch** | 2-min animated video showing fire scenarios in a coal mine. Voice-over in selected language. Jharkhand mine setting. | Auto-play, subtitles |
| **Learn** | 5 interactive flashcards: Types of fires (A/B/C/D), Extinguisher types (Water/CO2/Foam/DCP), Evacuation rules, Assembly points, Emergency numbers | Swipe cards, tap to flip |
| **AR Sim** | **Guided Practice**: Fire in workshop — AR identifies exits, guides navigation. Electrical fire — highlights correct extinguisher, shows PASS technique overlay. Includes humorous warnings for wrong moves. | Camera-based AR, tap/swipe/shake interactions |
| **Assess** | **AR Practical Exam**: Unannounced virtual fire spawns. No hints. Worker must physically turn to the correct exit or select the correct extinguisher in AR within 30 seconds. Score based on speed and accuracy. | Timed AR interaction |

### Module 2: Gas Leak & Confined Space Protocol 💨

| Stage | Content | Interaction |
|:------|:--------|:------------|
| **Watch** | 2-min animated video showing gas leak in underground mine. Shows symptoms of CO/CH4 exposure. | Auto-play, subtitles |
| **Learn** | 5 flashcards: Gas types & dangers, PPE for confined spaces, Air quality testing, Buddy system rules, Emergency evacuation signals | Swipe cards, tap to flip |
| **AR Sim** | **Guided Practice**: Detect hazard zone (AR red overlay), select correct PPE. Funny voice prompts if wrong PPE is picked ("Helmet भूल गया? सिर पत्थर का है क्या?"). Confined space entry protocol with visual hints. | Camera AR, drag-and-drop, voice commands |
| **Assess** | **AR Practical Exam**: Simulated gas leak. Worker must equip correct AR PPE and move to safe zone within a time limit. No hints provided. Score based on correct sequence of actions. | Timed AR interaction |

